 "operation": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.1 Initial Display",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Title 'Route Percentage', breadcrumb 'Master - Route Percentage'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Route Entry in Add Mode: Route Code, Route Description and Distance blank; stops table empty; Percentage blank.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "List Active Route Percentage: active routes, newest first, 10 per page. Footer: Total Percentage. No data: message no. 15.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.2 Building the Route (RP-01, RP-02)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Location Pick lists ACTIVE Master Location as 'Code - Name'. Selecting adds the location as the last stop (no. 1 / 2 / 3).",
    "Descr: first stop START, last stop END, the others VIA.",
    "Move up / down swaps two stops; Delete removes a stop.",
    "After every change: Route Code = codes joined by '_', Route Description = names joined by ' - ', Distance recalculated."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.3 Distance (RP-04)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Each leg From -> To uses the Active Master Mileage KM; if none, the straight-line distance between the Master Location coordinates (estimate).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Distance = sum of the legs, 2 decimals; marked 'est.' when a leg is estimated. Source of distance TBD (OP-01).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "Route",
     "width": 14
    },
    {
     "title": "Legs",
     "width": 22
    },
    {
     "title": "Distance",
     "width": 10
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "D1_S1_X1",
     "D1->S1 3 (Mileage) + S1->X1 14 (Mileage)",
     "17"
    ],
    [
     "A1_A2",
     "A1->A2 113.93 (estimate)",
     "113.93 est."
    ]
   ],
   "level": 2,
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.4 Save (RP-01, RP-03, RP-05, RP-06)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Step 1 - At least 2 stops (no. 4), all active, none twice in a row (no. 5). Stop.",
    "Step 2 - Route Code not used by an active route, excluding the edited one (no. 6). Stop.",
    "Step 3 - Percentage required (no. 7), 0 < % <= 100 with max 2 decimals (no. 8). Stop.",
    "Step 4 - Total of active routes incl. this one <= 100% (no. 9). Stop.",
    "Step 5 - Edit: version check (no. 10). Save route and stops in one transaction.",
    "Success: clear Route Entry, refresh list, message no. 11 / 12."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.5 Percentage in the List (RP-07)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Change the value and press Enter or leave the box: same checks as Save step 3-4; error: old value restored (no. 8 / 9).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Success: message no. 12; Total Percentage refreshed.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.6 Opsi: Edit / Deactivate (RP-08, RP-09)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Edit loads stops and percentage into Route Entry (title 'Route Entry - Edit {Code}'); Clear returns to Add Mode.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Deactivate: confirmation no. 13; status Inactive, removed from the list, percentage released (no. 14). Not physically deleted.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.7 Total Percentage and PR Creation (RP-06, RP-10)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Total Percentage = sum of active routes; green at 100%, otherwise '(x% unassigned)'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "PR creation splits the quantity over active routes in proportion to the percentage (largest remainder; ties by higher percentage, then code). What is split and whether 100% is required: TBD (OP-02).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.8 Search, Kolom, Sort",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Search on all visible columns; no match: message no. 16.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Kolom shows / hides columns; Percentage header toggles descending / ascending / default order.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.9 Security and Audit",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Access follows the existing role framework (View / Add / Edit / Deactivate Route Percentage, TBD).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Audit: Created By / Dt, Changed By / Dt.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "page_break"
  },
  {
